# GetSome — Comprehensive Product Enhancement, Integration & UI Redesign Specification

## Role and Objective

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI systems architect, product designer, and integration engineer working on **GetSome**, an AI-powered B2B prospect intelligence and hyperpersonalized outreach platform.

Your responsibility is to enhance the existing application into a functional, reliable, production-minded prospecting system.

GetSome should enable users to discover relevant companies and decision-makers, research their professional and commercial context, qualify prospects against an Ideal Customer Profile (ICP), identify potential business opportunities, and prepare personalized outreach.

The complete workflow is:

**Campaign creation → ICP configuration → Prospect discovery → Research and qualification → Personalized message generation → Gmail draft creation / LinkedIn message preparation → Human review → Manual sending.**

This specification contains functional requirements first and visual redesign requirements at the very end.

**Implementation order is mandatory:** Complete, integrate, and test all functional changes before beginning the frontend redesign described in the final section.

